# pathing-walkto.vrs: the pathing probe (design §9 D50, docs/RESEARCH_NOTES.md › Pathing levers). Does the game's own
# "walk to a position" buff make our spawned units walk (not jump) to a mark about 110 m away? Two buffs: Valyr's
# WalkToPos (131220609) and Lucie's WalkToPotion (-1341107993). Evidence only: the distances are read from the
# [DEV UNIT] lines afterwards (a walk shrinks the distance a few metres a second; a jump moves more than 6 m a second).
#
# Needs: NyarDevTools with .devwalkto; Chaos invulnerable (`ToggleInvulnerable true` only); marks pond and ravine.
ensure
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
console TPHome
wait 3
# (a) Valyr's WalkToPos: 5 spiders at the pond, Chaos 70 m east so they stay idle and enabled
chat .devgo pond
expect-log \[DEV TP\] pond
wait 4
console ToggleInvulnerable true
chat .nyar spawn CHAR_Spider_Forest 5
expect-reply spawned 5 CHAR_Spider_Forest
wait 8
chat .devtp -1810 -1640
expect-log \[DEV TP\]
wait 6
chat .devunits -581295882 200 ravine
expect-log \[DEV UNITS\] n=(?P<N0>[0-9]+)
chat .devwalkto -581295882 ravine 131220609 120 100 5
expect-log \[DEV WALKTO\] put=(?P<PUT>[0-9]+) nobuff=(?P<NOBUFF>[0-9]+) buff=131220609 mark=ravine d=(?P<D0>[0-9.]+)
wait 5
chat .devunits -581295882 200 ravine
wait 10
chat .devunits -581295882 200 ravine
wait 15
chat .devunits -581295882 200 ravine
wait 30
chat .devunits -581295882 200 ravine
wait 30
chat .devunits -581295882 200 ravine
shot full walkto-valyr
# a purge would start the 240 s purge cooldown and refuse part (b)'s spawn (run 1): the units are killed instead
chat .devkill -581295882 200
expect-log \[DEV KILL\] n=
wait 10
# (b) Lucie's WalkToPotion, the same set-up
chat .devgo pond
expect-log \[DEV TP\] pond
wait 4
chat .nyar spawn CHAR_Spider_Forest 5
expect-reply spawned 5 CHAR_Spider_Forest
wait 8
chat .devtp -1810 -1640
wait 6
chat .devwalkto -581295882 ravine -1341107993 120 100 5
expect-log \[DEV WALKTO\] put=(?P<PUT2>[0-9]+) nobuff=(?P<NOBUFF2>[0-9]+) buff=-1341107993 mark=ravine d=(?P<D2>[0-9.]+)
wait 5
chat .devunits -581295882 200 ravine
wait 25
chat .devunits -581295882 200 ravine
wait 30
chat .devunits -581295882 200 ravine
wait 30
chat .devunits -581295882 200 ravine
shot full walkto-lucie
chat .nyar purge
wait 2
chat .nyar purge confirm
wait 10
console TPHome
wait 3
